    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You served in the guard, out of either patriotism or the need for coin. Either way, you know how to get a difficult suspect to talk. However you left the guard, you might think of adventuring as a way to use your skills on a wider stage.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Intimidation skill and the Legal Lore or Warfare Lore skill. You gain the Quick Coercion skill feat."
    },
